-=About Lojban=-
* Basic Information: you can read or download ((What Is Lojban?, The Book)), also known as the Level Zero book. 
* Faster Information: ((Frequently Asked Questions About Lojban)) page or the ((About Lojban)) page.

-=Learning Lojban=-
* Official Lojban Dictionary:(jbovlaste)  [http://jbovlaste.lojban.org/|jbovlaste]
* Lojban Attitudinals:(wikibooks list) [http://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Lojban/Attitudinals]
* Lojban for Beginners:(tutorial) [http://www.tlg.uci.edu/~opoudjis/lojbanbrochure/lessons/book1.html]
* Complete Lojban Language:(reference)  [http://www.lojban.org/tiki/tiki-index.php?page=The+Complete+Lojban+Language&bl]

-=Lojban Community=-
* How did you hear about Lojban? if you have a minute tell us here: ((Lojban: first time))
* Lojban MOO: (virtual world) [http://mooix.lojban.org]
* Mailing List: [http://www.lojban.org/lsg2/]
* IRC: irc.freenode.net #lojban, via webchat at [http://www.lojban.org/irc/] or using [http://embed.mibbit.com/?server=irc.freenode.net&channel=%23lojban&noServerTab=false|mibbit with this link].
* Lojban Blog: [http://community.livejournal.com/lojban]
* Lojban Community or to use Lojban more effectively, please look at the ((Lojban Resources)) page.


-=Miscellaneous=-
* If you still can't find what you are looking for please use the ((Popular Pages)) page, or use the search menu at the upper left.
* If you are looking for information about the Logical Language Group, Inc., please go to the ((The Logical Language Group|Logical Language Group)) page.
* You can change the appearance of the site by selecting "MyTiki" (from the small menu) and selecting the image of the wrench and screwdriver.


